          "html": "<article class=\"story\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Villages · 8 min</span><h1>The last light on the harbour</h1>\n<p>Arrive before nine and the piazza belongs to the fishermen mending nets, not to the day trippers stepping off the train.</p>\n<p>By noon the boats are out and the harbour wall is warm enough to sit on; the light turns gold an hour before sunset.</p>\n<p>Walk up to the tower for the view, then down again for a slice of focaccia still warm from the oven.</p></article>"
